== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: vucomxsh [ENC: EVEX, MAP: MAP5, OPC: 0x2E]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AVX512
    ISA-SET: AVX512_COM_EF_SCALAR
    ISA-EXT: AVX512EVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: E3NF
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX CPUFLAG_ACCESS ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 55 7E 08 2E 69 40 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R     MODRM_REG    128      8      16   FLOAT16                        xmm13
 1     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM     16      1      16   FLOAT16  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                  r9
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000080
 2   REGISTER      HIDDEN       W          NONE     64     64       1       INT                       rflags
