== [    FLAGS ] ============================================================================================
    ACTIONS: [CF  : M  ] [PF  : M  ] [AF  : 0  ] [ZF  : M  ] [SF  : M  ] [OF  : M  ] 
       READ: 0x00000000
    WRITTEN: 0x000008D5

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 128
  BROADCAST: NONE
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: N
       MASK: k0 [DISABLED]

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vucomxshw 0x80(%r9), %xmm13
   RELATIVE: vucomxshw 0x80(%r9), %xmm13

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vucomxsh xmm13, word ptr ds:[r9+0x80]
   RELATIVE: vucomxsh xmm13, word ptr ds:[r9+0x80]

